This script:

1. Loads each required `.tab` file (skipping any that are missing or empty).
2. Merges all data frames by the cohort identifier `NSID`.
3. Converts all wave‑specific NS‑SEC fractional codes to their major category by taking the integer part, applies the standard missing‑value mapping, and sets the appropriate default codes.
4. Special‑cased `nssec25` to assign “Full‑time students” (code 15) when the concurrent activity code indicates full‑time education.
5. Outputs a single CSV containing `NSID` and the six cleaned NS‑SEC variables (`nssec17`, `nssec18`, `nssec19`, `nssec20`, `nssec25`, `nssec32`) with values and missing‑codes according to the specifications.

